  "design": {
    "idea": "Split-tier Counterweight Shaft combining Dawn->Dusk->War 3-tone sequence with Shutter Hood darkness: ring Dawn at center, hang lantern on the West hook to cloak dark, strike Dusk to freeze the watcher portrait, slip dark through the East Shadow Gate to strike War, opening the Clock Face stair and dropping the Master Lift to r1.",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ten",
    "teaches": "Synthesizing Island 1's 3 tones with Shutter Hood stealth and Shadow Gate traversal.",
    "decisions": 10,
    "expert_s": 65,
    "reward": "belfry_master_lift",
    "why": "Floor 3 gateway uniting both minor dungeon powers and connecting F3 directly to F1 Narthex via Master Lift.",
